<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">Our verification team has looked at your application to join RightProperty365 as <strong>{{.RoleName}}</strong> and needs something changed before it can be approved.</p>
<table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;background-color:#f8f9fc;border:1px solid #e6e9f0;border-radius:10px;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="fact-label" valign="top" width="38%" style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">Role</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.RoleName}}</td></tr><tr><td class="fact-label" valign="top" width="38%" style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">Status</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.StatusText}}</td></tr><tr><td class="fact-label" valign="top" width="38%" style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">What to change</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.Reason}}</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">Please update your application and submit it again. Your details and documents are saved, so you only need to change what is asked for.</p>
{{end}}
